Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.41,0:00:03.45,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Hi there. Welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.17,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Do you want a Wonder Egg?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.17,0:00:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.17,0:00:12.00,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,What? You're not sure yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.59,0:00:13.92,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.30,0:00:17.34,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Have courage and believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.67,0:00:19.63,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Break the Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.93,0:00:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.93,0:00:24.60,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It has the thing you want in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.60,0:00:27.30,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It has your wish in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.98,0:00:31.65,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,If you crack it in the Egg world...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.11,0:00:34.56,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,and if you clear your mission...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a little warm.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.40,0:00:42.49,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You might be able to get it back.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.49,0:00:43.24,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Your friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.99,0:00:45.33,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Your memories.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.87,0:00:47.25,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Your loved one.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.37,0:00:52.29,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The first time's free. After that, bring your wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.83,0:00:56.50,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,What? How do we make the Eggs?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:56.50,0:00:59.60,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,That's a trade secret.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.79,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We can't just tell you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.43,0:01:06.47,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I know: Let us tell you about our regular customers instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.93,0:01:09.93,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,A group of four charming young girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.93,0:01:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our story that no one else knows about, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.27,0:01:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A story... that no one knows about.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.99,0:01:23.03,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Listen, and then make up your mind
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.03,0:01:26.54,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,about whether you'll bring home an Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.08,0:01:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going out.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.45,0:01:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.01,0:01:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.35,0:01:50.43,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,This isn't reality. It's a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.43,0:01:54.52,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Or, well, let's call it the "Egg world."
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.52,0:01:57.94,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,A world only people who've broken an Egg can connect to.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.94,0:02:01.24,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It's strongly influenced by your mental landscape.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.24,0:02:06.66,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,And under certain conditions, you can \Nshare that world with other people.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.66,0:02:07.37,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Fun, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.78,0:02:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You synchronized.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.33,0:02:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We what?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.33,0:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell asleep near each other \Nand at almost the same time, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.42,0:02:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But why aren't we in my dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.63,0:02:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pulled by whoever's feelings are stronger.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.30,0:02:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Break the Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.14,0:02:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egg?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.47,0:02:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wonder Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.77,0:02:35.27,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,When you crack a Wonder Egg, \Na girl emerges from inside it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.48,0:02:43.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,They're girls who approached death \Nof their own will and left this life,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.07,0:02:45.24,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,but you will protect them.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.70,0:02:46.91,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,What from?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.28,0:02:50.28,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,From Seeno Evils and Wonder Killers.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.12,0:02:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.33,0:02:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to know!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.29,0:03:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're Seeno Evils!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.01,0:03:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.68,0:03:09.14,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get right to one of our regulars.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.47,0:03:11.97,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Her name is Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.97,0:03:14.93,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,A 14-year-old with mismatched eye colors.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.93,0:03:16.77,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,A middle-school second year.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.40,0:03:19.81,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ai! Your teacher is here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.11,0:03:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to force her to get up, ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.03,0:03:27.03,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,When she met us, she wouldn't go to school.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.03,0:03:30.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She says she was bullied for her heterochromia.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.07,0:03:34.33,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not why she was skipping school, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.50,0:03:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.29,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A game.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.79,0:03:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like games?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.88,0:03:48.18,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Ai's meeting with Nagase Koito, a new student \Nin her class, changed her destiny in a big way.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mysterious.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.93,0:03:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't hide it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.89,0:03:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I get bullied for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.39,0:03:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.52,0:03:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.49,0:04:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.24,0:04:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be best friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.04,0:04:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could, I'd be happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.96,0:04:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.97,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She finally made a best friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.97,0:04:31.80,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,But one day, she lost her without warning.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.93,0:04:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.97,0:04:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Classic harassment.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they do this to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.94,0:04:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're my friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.56,0:04:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.90,0:04:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They say Mr. Sawaki is giving me special treatment.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're jealous.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.74,0:04:55.79,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.66,0:04:58.66,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Scared of being left out.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.88,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.72,0:05:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get the video?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.26,0:05:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You were scared, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.14,0:05:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.14,0:05:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.43,0:05:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.77,0:05:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you tried your best.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.19,0:05:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.65,0:05:26.11,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.82,0:05:30.99,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Because I betrayed you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.74,0:05:34.16,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Nagase Koito committed suicide.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.16,0:05:35.58,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Why'd she die?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.33,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,What was Ai lacking?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.79,0:05:40.66,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Who pushed Koito toward it?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.66,0:05:44.50,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Ai is fighting to get back the best friend she lost.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.50,0:05:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done pretending not to see!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.92,0:05:50.09,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.63,0:05:53.51,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,There was a part of me that resented her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.84,0:05:58.06,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We were friends, so why didn't she talk to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.14,0:05:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.22,0:06:02.56,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,If she'd asked me to die with her...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.23,0:06:04.23,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I'd...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.28,0:06:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.49,0:06:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.91,0:06:24.42,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,A mission's victory condition is to defeat a Wonder Killer,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.79,0:06:28.67,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,{\q2}a symbol of the Egg girl's discord, obsession, or trauma.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.71,0:06:33.80,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,In the Egg world, you're immortal.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.80,0:06:37.05,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,And your physical abilities dramatically increase.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.05,0:06:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.89,0:06:46.27,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You may be immortal, but watch out for injuries.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.27,0:06:49.44,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,If you come back hurt, you'll end up like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.44,0:06:50.73,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Aonuma Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.73,0:06:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my contact info.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.28,0:06:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Message me when you want to change plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.86,0:06:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy Eggs on odd days; you buy them on even days.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.16,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.08,0:07:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have to meet again.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.12,0:07:07.04,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Neiru's a girl genius. She's just 14, \Nbut she runs her own company.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.04,0:07:08.00,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.00,0:07:14.63,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She's calm, not very talkative, and not very outgoing.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.38,0:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.89,0:07:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.51,0:07:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This smells amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.52,0:07:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.14,0:07:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.57,0:07:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trusting, Ai. You forgive easily.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.03,0:07:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.58,0:07:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lovely that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.58,0:07:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless {\i1}and{\i0} lovely that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.54,0:07:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We need someone like that \Nsometimes, or we'll never be saved.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.13,0:07:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A capable woman actually spoils them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.38,0:07:59.64,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She seems to have taken to Ai, \Nbut she's a little too harsh on Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.97,0:07:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Because it's your turn.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.30,0:08:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an anachronistic fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.31,0:08:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "fool"?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.73,0:08:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Coochy-coochy-coo...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.56,0:08:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How about here?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.73,0:08:15.36,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Still, she has her charms.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.82,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,They really get along, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.36,0:08:16.69,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,One of those "tsunderes"?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.82,0:08:16.69,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.69,0:08:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.07,0:08:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this spot?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.08,0:08:28.37,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Neiru is buying Eggs and fighting to get back her little sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.71,0:08:31.63,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Who are you fighting for?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.63,0:08:33.17,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's not for yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.47,0:08:36.46,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You don't like who you are now, so you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.46,0:08:38.35,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Even if you're scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.68,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You want to change the self you hate.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.68,0:08:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go, but I have to.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.22,0:08:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.76,0:08:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For someone selfish enough to... kill themselves...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.85,0:08:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, Neiru's trying to save her sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.69,0:08:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.57,0:08:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister stabbed me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, she ran away and jumped off a bridge.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.90,0:09:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.66,0:09:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they told me when I woke up in the ICU.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.03,0:09:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you've got even less of a reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.91,0:09:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The scar aches and keeps me awake.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.21,0:09:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But the pain has faded since I started going there.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.17,0:09:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When I try to forget her, my scar aches, like a curse.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I go.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.76,0:09:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.06,0:09:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.27,0:09:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls become adults.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.73,0:09:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The miraculous beauty of a butterfly emerging.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.57,0:09:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A brief moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.53,0:09:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty, too. Why don't you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.07,0:09:44.79,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Why not die when you're at your most beautiful?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.79,0:09:47.03,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Why cling to a meaningless life?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.41,0:09:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.03,0:09:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.99,0:09:48.62,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.70,0:09:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.70,0:09:48.91,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you die?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.25,0:09:51.50,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.13,0:09:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.71,0:09:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.71,0:09:51.91,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.00,0:09:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.00,0:09:55.84,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.75,0:09:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.04,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.51,0:10:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.30,0:10:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"Why don't I die," huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.30,0:10:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You tempted me to die, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.81,0:10:18.86,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Experience gained in the Egg world \Nis directly reflected in reality.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.86,0:10:23.45,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,For example, as you run and jump \Nthere, your athleticism improves.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.95,0:10:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like fighting there puts \Na heavy strain on our bodies.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.12,0:10:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like high-altitude training?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.33,0:10:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.33,0:10:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you mention it, I think \NI've gotten some definition on my abs.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.71,0:10:42.05,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Your wounds heal faster, too, \Nso heal up before you come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.97,0:10:48.93,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It might be a bit tough at first.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.43,0:10:50.93,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It takes practice.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.81,0:10:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.39,0:10:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to change.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.02,0:10:58.40,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You can do it, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.48,0:11:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.40,0:11:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.03,0:11:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.61,0:11:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.87,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.49,0:11:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.41,0:11:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You just want attention!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.04,0:11:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What you really mean is that you \Nwant someone to find you and love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.75,0:11:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I won't leave you alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.46,0:11:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}can't{\i0} leave you alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.26,0:11:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's just abuse!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.01,0:11:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Coach!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.19,0:11:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.62,0:12:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,These aren't Seeno Evils!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.38,0:12:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're Haters.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.67,0:12:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done too much to stand out in this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.38,0:12:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Envy and spite created Haters \Nof you girls from among the Seeno Evils.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.93,0:12:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have the guts to show \Ntheir faces, but they do have madness.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're strong in groups.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.48,0:12:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe as strong as a boss.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.65,0:12:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Run or hide.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.27,0:12:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're after you: the "heroes" in the limelight.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.94,0:12:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide here until the bell rings.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.49,0:12:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't clear the mission if you don't fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.32,0:12:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, focus on maintaining the status quo for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.91,0:12:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a solution in mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.79,0:12:38.92,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,But Yae is hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.92,0:12:39.73,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,It's my fault she—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.73,0:12:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.25,0:12:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll regenerate in as little as ten minutes in her Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.38,0:12:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, they found us?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.17,0:12:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Egg girl until time runs out.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.97,0:12:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your top priority.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.76,0:12:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Society is built on "report, contact, consult."
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.35,0:12:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it out loud and share it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our greatest objective is...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.14,0:13:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Egg...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Priority.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.86,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,As we were saying,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.11,0:13:12.99,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,this girl is Kawai Rika, a former junior idol.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.91,0:13:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember it as {\i1}Kawaii{\i0} Rika, since I'm so super cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.79,0:13:23.58,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She's talkative, excitable, and above all, greedy.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.58,0:13:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I forgot my wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.05,0:13:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could you spot me cash?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.05,0:13:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.09,0:13:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.22,0:13:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.34,0:13:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come see me again, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.85,0:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.27,0:13:40.64,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She may seem indomitable at first glance,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.56,0:13:43.40,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,but her home life is complicated.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.40,0:13:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My daddy says a beautiful woman doesn't need a wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.11,0:13:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone will always offer to pay for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.19,0:13:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he got divorced.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.03,0:13:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these five is my real daddy.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.37,0:13:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So, which one is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.37,0:14:00.95,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Rika doesn't know her real father.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.41,0:14:06.17,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She obsesses over the father she's \Nnever met and dislikes her mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.46,0:14:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, I don't know either.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.05,0:14:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm preeetty sure it's one of these guys, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.97,0:14:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll meet him someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.89,0:14:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.89,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet him {\i1}now{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.90,0:14:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.28,0:14:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.49,0:14:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.91,0:14:45.37,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The girl Rika wants to save is Chiemi, \Na fan from her junior idol days.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.37,0:14:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My little wallet who'd buy me anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.67,0:14:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiemi was a real idiot.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.22,0:14:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She got in line for me dozens, maybe hundreds of times.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.30,0:15:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She just gave me all her allowance \Nand New Year's money with a smile.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.48,0:15:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed I had a rich patron.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.77,0:15:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I saw her shoplifting in town.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.69,0:15:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd been selling what she stole.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I totally know that feeling.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.19,0:15:25.62,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got sugar daddies for the same reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.92,0:15:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want that.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.00,0:15:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I told her I'd never be friends with a fan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.13,0:15:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd be too embarrassed to be \Nseen with a fatty in the first place.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.51,0:15:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, "Never come back."
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.51,0:15:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, another fan told me what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.51,0:15:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiemi died.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.97,0:15:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She was skin and bones, like a mummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.69,0:15:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't forget her if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.52,0:15:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't Chiemi.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.28,0:16:00.37,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She regrets that something she said \Nended up driving Chiemi to her death.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.37,0:16:01.70,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,That's why she fights.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.74,0:16:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hit you with a shot to the heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.33,0:16:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.50,0:16:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's with those Haters?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.25,0:16:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who asked them to treat us like \Nheroes? We're not doing this for fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.97,0:16:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you "had a solution in mind"?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.01,0:16:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Look, here it is now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.14,0:16:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.14,0:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That case contains things that will support you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.19,0:16:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, it's what you call a "power up."
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.86,0:16:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do we use them?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you hatch them in this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.70,0:16:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatch them?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.74,0:16:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't do it here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home and open them when you're alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.91,0:16:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.41,0:16:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They require imprinting.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.33,0:16:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They see whoever meets their gaze first as their parent.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.75,0:16:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chant "{\i1}veni{\i0}" to call them from \Ntheir eggs. "{\i1}Redi{\i0}" to return them.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.80,0:17:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.18,0:17:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A snake.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.06,0:17:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.24,0:17:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to react.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.16,0:17:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.46,0:17:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.58,0:17:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Haters are their favorite food.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.92,0:17:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Envy and spite are their bread and butter.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.96,0:17:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.88,0:17:45.64,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,And finally, there's Sawaki Momoe.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.47,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She's a tall, slender girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.35,0:17:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just one day, but I fell in love with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.90,0:17:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad that I got to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.27,0:18:01.78,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She says she's often mistaken \Nfor a boy or gets asked out by girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.70,0:18:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.24,0:18:09.83,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Well, everything she says or does is cool and handsome.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.17,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.63,0:18:20.34,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She might be the most "normal" of the four.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.84,0:18:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you. I don't want to disappear.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.84,0:18:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.77,0:18:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There are more than you'd think, Haruka.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.56,0:18:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls like you, who say they love me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.56,0:18:41.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The girl Momoe wants to save is Haruka.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.49,0:18:49.12,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She’s got complicated circumstances of her own.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.79,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruka was willing to see me as a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.34,0:18:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.75,0:18:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend who killed herself?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.79,0:18:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.25,0:19:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But she suddenly took her clothes off in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.59,0:19:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She put the moves on you? Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.64,0:19:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I got scared and ended up pushing her away.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.72,0:19:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.93,0:19:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.73,0:19:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Aren't you Mr. Sawaki's...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.40,0:19:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawaki Momoe. I'm his niece.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.94,0:19:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pretty young lady.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.61,0:19:28.70,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,And one of Momoe's relatives, \NSawaki Shuichiro, is Ai's teacher.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.95,0:19:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to have a complex.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.49,0:19:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are charming.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.12,0:19:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.08,0:19:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll paint how you look to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.50,0:19:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's finished, I want you to have confidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.09,0:19:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear Mr. Sawaki's entering it in the next exhibition.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.22,0:19:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he wants to win a prize \Nand make a living as a painter.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.76,0:19:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A painting of me?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.22,0:19:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Confident?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.14,0:19:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, you should decline.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.64,0:19:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's future is on the line.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.11,0:20:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.36,0:20:05.49,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Sawaki Shuichiro is disturbing Ai's mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.28,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,His relationship with Nagase Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.70,0:20:12.41,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,His relationship with Ai's mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.99,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen calmly, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.54,0:20:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been thinking that we'd like to start dating.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.50,0:20:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that my uncle might have been \Ninvolved in Koito's suicide?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, there's no way.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.10,0:20:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll never know the truth \Nunless we bring Koito back and ask her.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.39,0:20:38.44,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Mr. S.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.73,0:20:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.98,0:20:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There might be a factor complicating matters.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.23,0:20:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.40,0:20:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai likes Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.74,0:20:52.87,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,If the truth were easy to find, no one would struggle.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.28,0:20:51.99,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ohto?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.87,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The human heart is difficult to fathom.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.28,0:20:55.87,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.62,0:21:00.42,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It looks like Ai's made up her mind to hunt down the truth,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.00,0:21:02.88,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,but we'll have to see where that goes.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.21,0:21:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.01,0:21:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.39,0:21:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,going to go to school!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.19,0:21:30.24,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Well, that's pretty much how you use the Eggs.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.95,0:21:33.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't seem too enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.45,0:21:36.54,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You look as though you can't trust us.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.54,0:21:40.37,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Really? After we broke it all down for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.87,0:21:43.04,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,That's not nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.04,0:21:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We protect these girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,From monsters.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.09,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a women-only car!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.34,0:21:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a girl, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.13,0:21:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.85,0:21:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worn out.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.14,0:22:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be saved.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.56,0:22:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.90,0:22:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.11,0:22:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've got to... protect your mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.82,0:22:14.70,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,All right. Next, we'll tell you about ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.16,0:22:17.83,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Info about us'll cost you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.83,0:22:20.75,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,However, that's all for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.75,0:22:24.25,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Drop in again if you want to hear more.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.25,0:22:25.54,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.38,0:22:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mannen!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.80,0:22:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you off your feet with a shot to the heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.14,0:22:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if I protect a bunch more people, \Nwill Koito come back to life?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.56,0:22:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She will, right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:48.23,0:22:49.57,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
